    "body": "The existing [system focus](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#system-focus) concept is _\"when it can receive keyboard input channeled from the operating system\"_, so wouldn't it be weird to say either the traversable has keyboard input OR its UI (url bar) has user input?\r\n\r\nI'm also not sure what user input would cover. E.g. any visible surface might seem eligible for touch input.",
