    "body": "It means the browser window lost keyboard focus, which seems consistent with existing language in [notes](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#flush-autofocus-candidates):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1230\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3136226/229838298-63e12445-ed38-4a86-9fe9-05dba042c882.png\">\r\n\r\nThe note in this PR attempts to clarify the difference between [user attention](https://whatpr.org/html/8466/interaction.html#user-attention) and [system focus](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#system-focus) which both operate on that (the ability to _\"receive keyboard input channeled from the operating system\"_).",
    "created_at": "2023-04-04T15:05:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-04T15:34:54Z",
